5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all get along while we find the werewolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasant start indeed. I shall be observing the flow of our conversation with great interest.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to be here. Let us approach this mystery with patience and wisdom.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,I'm sure I'll be able to spot the liar in no time! This should be fun.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'll protect everyone and make sure the werewolf doesn't get away.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,Does anyone have a plan for how we should vote?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"On this first day, any vote would be mere conjecture. I suggest we simply observe.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,I agree with Benjamin. Let us listen to each other's hearts first.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,Boring! But I suppose we can't do much without information.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'll just watch everyone. If anyone acts weird, I'm calling them out!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
