31,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I hope everyone slept well.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I slept quite well, thank you. However, I have some rather unsettling news to share.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"You sound troubled, Benjamin. Please, tell us what is on your mind.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh, is the mystery starting already? Don't keep us in suspense!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What is it? Did you find something?,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"What news, Benjamin?","{""words"":3,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I am the Seer. I divined Minato last night, and I'm afraid he is the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a very serious claim. Minato, what do you have to say?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"Wow, right out of the gate! Minato, are you really the bad guy?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Minato? No way, he's too quiet to be a werewolf!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I... I'm not! Benjamin is lying! I'm just a villager, I promise!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Your distress is noted, but the divination is absolute. Logic dictates we act now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a difficult position. However, the Seer's guidance is our strongest light.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,I don't know... Minato looks so scared. But Benjamin seems so sure.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, are you absolutely sure? You aren't just trying to trick us?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,Please believe me! I'm not the werewolf!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I assure you, Takumi, my role is genuine. To ignore this evidence would be irrational.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,I believe Benjamin. Let us trust in the truth he has uncovered.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"Well, if the smart guy and the old guy agree, I'm in. Sorry, Minato!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I still don't like it, but if Benjamin is the Seer, we have to vote.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
